Forked at upstream tag v0.1.8-20260210143125.

Modifications made in this fork (Apache-2.0 section 4b):
  - Rebranded to Kablan: name, product identity, npm package and binaries,
    MCP server identity, on-disk directories, and the identity used to author
    commits made on the user's behalf.
  - Removed analytics and crash reporting. posthog-js and @sentry/react are
    aliased to no-op modules at build time; the Rust Sentry integration sends
    nothing unless KABLAN_SENTRY_DSN is set.
  - Removed calls to upstream's infrastructure: the Discord online-count poll,
    the GitHub star count, the hosted feature tour, and the browser companion
    installer.
  - Removed upstream's promotional text from the generated pull request
    description prompt.
  - Removed the in-app browser preview; a running dev server is reported and
    opened in a real browser instead.
  - Removed the beta "workspaces" UI (the /workspaces and /projects routes and
    the code only they reached).
  - Added a list view for tasks, alongside the board.
  - Redesigned the projects page as a list with per-project icons, task counts,
    and inline expansion.
  - Redesigned the task view into three columns: the task list, the agent
    conversation, and a details column for the attempt.
  - Added dev server controls and environment-file editing, with a prompt to
    replace a dev server already held by another task.
  - Added running and dev-server indicators to the task list and board.
  - Added a dark theme and a theme switcher.

